designer_notes = "A CASTING FOE'S KIT (Luke's F1, 2026-11-12, FOES_PREP.md section 6): the imp's. Its bolt (a skill a bolt SpellDef flies) and its ring (a skill an area SpellDef lays), cast by the ranged tree; its string is one claw for a player in its reach. No pool: a foe's casts are paced by its FoeDef's rests. No weapon names it."
